{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>相簿裡總有大量幾乎一樣的相片，以及早已不再需要的截圖，逐張開啟再刪除相當費時。PicDecide 以左右滑動的方式，讓你逐張決定保留或暫存，適合想認真整理 iPhone 相簿的使用者。軟件原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>逐張滑動篩選相片</h2>\n<p>PicDecide 讓你逐張檢視相片，向右滑動保留、向左滑動暫存，未確定時可先儲存稍後再決定。你可檢視所有相片、截圖、影片或指定年月，並按最大檔案、最舊、最新或隨機排序。全螢幕放大細看，亦可撤銷決定或稍後繼續。向左滑動只會暫存項目，刪除前仍需經 Apple Photos 確認，決定與記錄只留在此裝置。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-139-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-140-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-141-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-142-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-143-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：PicDecide</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T21:58:57.890824+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":323,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T21:52:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T00:17:48.011087+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T21:57:41.813037+00:00","content_hash":"4782b99f0ab99c705103ec23a9f2ddd65f760ab23511d48826455b0ba666bffb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}